20260527.113108.370 [<ideas.........] tests) before or during extension load. Each dependency brings its own `libblas` / `libopenblas` / `libmkl` with overlapping
20260527.113108.955 [<ideas.........] symbol namespaces. On Linux, `RTLD_GLOBAL` effects and **interposable** BLAS mean the dynamic linker may bind `cblas_dgemm`
20260527.113109.961 [<ideas.........] against a DSO that exports BLAS Fortran symbols but **not** CBLAS wrappers, while `enn_rust.so` still carries an unresolved
20260527.113110.729 [<ideas.........] `cblas_dgemm` from a **statically expected** provider (e.g. transitive `cblas-sys` / Faiss path) that never became a direct
20260527.113110.808 [<ideas.........] `NEEDED` edge to `libcblas.so`.
